			"notes": "Version 0.3.0.\nChanges:\n+Added shared checklists synced through a Supabase-backed API -- create a list on the website, join it in-game with a share code.\n+Added group progress tracking: everyone's held quantity for an item adds up toward one shared target instead of just your own.\n+Added a \"Join Shared List\" screen for entering/leaving a synced list.\n+Added ability to remove items from a synced list by right-clicking them (removes it for everyone, not just locally)."
